# Director V3 / Remotion / video QA

For any task about Director V3, Remotion composition, video quality recovery, captions, shot plans, or `preview-v3`:

1. Load and follow **`docs/prompts/cinematic-director-v3-quality-recovery.md`** first (MAIN product prompt).
2. See also `docs/prompts/README.md`.
3. Hypit assembly handoff remains `backend/assembly_prompt.txt` — do not use it as the Director quality brief.
4. `docs/prompts/lumen-hypit-integration-cursor-prompt.md` is NOT the product MAIN prompt.
5. STOP generating new media unless the MAIN prompt explicitly authorizes it. Prefer fixing Director/Remotion/captions and reusing the library.
